<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Ipako Q1 net $5.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Ipako Q1 net $5.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended Sept 30.</p>
<p>Net $5.9 million vs $5.6 million</p>
<p>Note: The petrochemicals company had no extraordinary result. Net assets were $230 million compared with $138 million in the same period a year earlier. Full name is Ipako Industrias Petroquimicas Argentinas S.A.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 3180668.</p>
</text>
